### 1. Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### 2. Signup (naya user)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Creator",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@1234",
  "role": "creator"
}

### 3. Wohi email dobara (409 aana chahiye)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Creator",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@1234",
  "role": "creator"
}

### 4. Chhota password (400 aana chahiye)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Short Pass",
  "email": "short@example.com",
  "password": "123",
  "role": "creator"
}

### 5. Galat password se login (401 aana chahiye)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@postflow.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}

### 6. Sahi login (token milega)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@postflow.com",
  "password": "Demo@1234"
}

### 7. Token ke bina /me (401 aana chahiye)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me

### 8. Token ke saath /me (user ki info aani chahiye)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}